DMD supports hidden symbol visibility on ELF and Mach-O

`-visibility=hidden` now hides definitions on ELF and Mach-O targets unless
explicitly marked `export`. Without this option, symbol visibility is unchanged.

The new `core.attribute.hidden` UDA hides individual functions and global
variables, including when compiling with `-visibility=public`. Explicit `export`
protection overrides `@hidden`.
